 "simplifications": [
  "Single company; res.company address flattened onto Core.Company (Odoo stores it on a linked partner).",
  "res.users replaced by Administration.Account + Partners.UserProfile (association, not generalization — Stage 3 inheritance rule).",
  "customer_rank/supplier_rank integers replaced by IsCustomer/IsVendor booleans.",
  "States, titles, industries, country groups dropped.",
  "Company-dependent properties (payment terms, pricelist) become plain associations (single company)."
